Work out head circumference, age or centile from the other two.

Usage: centiles head [OPTIONS] --sex <sex>

Options:
      --sex <sex>          The baby's sex. [env: CENTILES_SEX=] [possible values: male, female, m, f]
      --age <age>          Age, like 13w2d, 6m or 1y3m.
      --value <value>      Head circumference in cm.
      --centile <centile>  Centile, between 0 and 100.
      --compare <compare>  Comparison centile. Give with --age and --centile to find the age at which a child on this centile has the same value.
  -h, --help               Print help
